{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27214","headline":"荻塘西庄赠房元垂 · 张光朝","name":"荻塘西庄赠房元垂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门在荻塘西，塘高何联联。\n往昔分地利，远近无闲田。\n水国信污下，霖霪即成川。\n苗稼尽湮没，兹乡独丰年。\n家肥待亲懿，人乐思管弦。\n日晏始能起，盥漱看厨烟。\n酝酒寒正熟，养鱼长食鲜。\n黄昏钟未鸣，偃息早已眠。\n何意久城市，寂寥丘中缘。\n俯仰在颜色，区区人事间。\n忆昔炎汉时，乃知绮季贤。\n静默不能仕，养老终南山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张光朝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}